<h1>Visiting the Workshop</h1>
<div class="row mt-4">
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <h2>What Happens When You Bring a Bike In</h2>
    <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered mb-4">
      <li class="list-group-item">We record the bike details (make, model, serial number) and photograph existing scratches.</li>
      <li class="list-group-item">We give you an estimated day of completion.</li>
      <li class="list-group-item">For larger repairs, we inspect the bike and call you with an upfront quote before starting any work.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-6">
    <h2>Shop Location & Pickup</h2>
    <p>Flat tyre repairs go out the same afternoon whenever possible. Pickups take place directly at our front counter during opening hours.</p>
  </div>
</div>